      "instruction": "Read primary and fixed evidence. Request more fixed ranges when cross-section rules are needed. Propose candidates with exact source slices and literal case JSON paths; report uncertain/missing evidence. Return one impact-response-v1 JSON object. For action=read request fixed reads, with no final candidates or outcome. For action=finish state the unit_outcome, candidates and unresolved evidence. Cite only exact text actually supplied in primary/additional_fixed_reads or earlier user messages; normalized diff offsets are not original offsets. Case impacts must cite a complete version actually supplied in this call history. Catalog metadata is not text evidence. Use fixed_case_catalog and fixed_difference_catalog identities to request additional fixed evidence. Copy version_record_sha256 from fixed_case_catalog for case citations; it identifies the complete version record and is different from content_hash. Never invent or calculate this hash. Catalog hashes do not replace reading the complete case. Copy text_sha256 from the supplied source and quote its exact original slice. Applicability is only a suggestion; deployment remains unknown and all candidates require review. Do not claim complete project coverage from this unit. Do not execute or change official records.",
      "sha256": "63f130b4565cbf5971ec3a8ae4c8aa2635a03344ebf47368a1847db7dc601d61"
    },
    "workflow_protocol": {
